The '''Potion Bag''' allows players to store [[Potions]] and [[Mixins]]. It could be accessed from the [[SkyBlock Menu]] and is unlocked at {{Coll|Nether Wart 2}}. 

== Obtaining ==
The '''Potion Bag''' is unlocked at {{CollectionLink|Nether Wart|2}} and is upgraded throughout the Collection.

