== Tips ==
* [[Potions#Dungeon|Dungeon Potions]] bought from [[Ophelia]] or dropped from [[The Watcher#Floor 5|Speedy Watcher summons]] can be stored in the Potion Bag. This is useful for players who use Dungeon Potions or have no Inventory space to store the potions.

